0x010B • In these times of the future, man has explored many worlds, travelling  through space by the use of the SPICE.
0x010C • SPICE, the most precious substance, can only be found on one planet in the whole universe.
This planet is Arrakis, better known as DUNE.
0x010D • It's a dry desolate planet with vast deserts. There's never a drop of  rain on Dune.
0x010E • You are PAUL ATREIDES, son of Duke Leto Atreides.
0x010F • The HARKONNENS, long time enemies of your family, have come on Dune  to control the Spice production, in their brutal way.
0x0110 • But the Emperor of the Universe has just allowed you and the Atreides family  to go on Dune too.
0x0111 • You are determined to use this opportunity to drive the  Harkonnens out of Dune, with the help of the few natives, the FREMEN.
0x0112 • The story begins as you've just arrived on Dune, in an empty palace located  at a safe distance from the Harkonnen fortresses.
